        code: "# 1. Define the platform API: what a team may ask for.\napiVersion: apiextensions.crossplane.io/v2\nkind: CompositeResourceDefinition\nmetadata:\n  name: postgresinstances.platform.acme.internal\nspec:\n  scope: Namespaced                 # v2: XRs are namespaced; claims no longer exist\n  group: platform.acme.internal\n  names: { kind: PostgresInstance, plural: postgresinstances }\n  versions:\n    - name: v1alpha1\n      served: true\n      referenceable: true\n      schema:\n        openAPIV3Schema:\n          type: object\n          properties:\n            spec:\n              type: object\n              properties:\n                size: { type: string, enum: [small, medium, large], default: small }\n                retentionDays: { type: integer, minimum: 1, maximum: 35, default: 7 }\n                environment: { type: string, enum: [dev, staging, production] }\n              required: [environment]\n\n# 2. Compose it: a function pipeline renders the real cloud resources.\n---\napiVersion: apiextensions.crossplane.io/v1\nkind: Composition\nmetadata: { name: postgres-aws }\nspec:\n  compositeTypeRef: { apiVersion: platform.acme.internal/v1alpha1, kind: PostgresInstance }\n  mode: Pipeline                    # v2: functions are the only composition mechanism\n  pipeline:\n    - step: render\n      functionRef: { name: function-go-templating }\n      input:\n        apiVersion: gotemplating.fn.crossplane.io/v1beta1\n        kind: GoTemplate\n        inline:\n          template: |\n            apiVersion: rds.aws.upbound.io/v1beta1\n            kind: Instance\n            spec:\n              forProvider:\n                instanceClass: {{ if eq .observed.composite.resource.spec.size \"small\" }}db.t4g.small{{ else }}db.m6g.large{{ end }}\n                backupRetentionPeriod: {{ .observed.composite.resource.spec.retentionDays }}\n                storageEncrypted: true            # secure by default, not a team decision\n              deletionPolicy: {{ if eq .observed.composite.resource.spec.environment \"production\" }}Orphan{{ else }}Delete{{ end }}\n    - step: ready\n      functionRef: { name: function-auto-ready }\n\n# 3. What a product team actually writes.\n---\napiVersion: platform.acme.internal/v1alpha1\nkind: PostgresInstance\nmetadata: { name: orders-db, namespace: team-orders }\nspec:\n  size: small\n  environment: production\n  retentionDays: 14",
